# Store every file byte-for-byte, with no end-of-line conversion.
#
# This project's sources are GBK-encoded (not UTF-8) and deliberately mix CRLF
# and LF endings between files. Any automatic EOL normalisation would rewrite
# every line of every source file and corrupt the Chinese comments, so all
# conversion is disabled. Files remain diffable; only the EOL filter is off.
* -text
